## Why This Is Asked
The ingestion path must handle many streams with SLA-driven priorities and resilience under load.

## Key Concepts
- Bounded backpressure queues
- Per-stream prioritization and fairness
- Dynamic degradation paths
- Graceful shutdown and cancellation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal bounded-priority sketch (illustrative)
class PriorityQueue {
  constructor(max){ this.max=max; this.q={high:[],med:[],low:[]}; this.size=0; }
  async enqueue(stream, item){
    while(this.size>=this.max) await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,1));
    this.q[stream.priority].push({stream,item});
    this.size++;
  }
  async dequeue(){
    for (const p of ['high','med','low']){
      if (this.q[p].length){ const e=this.q[p].shift(); this.size--; return e; }
    }
    return null;
  }
}
```

